body:
Just ported an angular2 app from systemjs to webpack, got the same issue. 
Only Workaround for now is naming everything that should be reexported directly:

For the given example:

```
// in first/second/index.js
export {wtf} from './thing';

// in first/index.js
export {wtf} from './second';

// in index.js
export {wtf} from './first';
```

This get cumbersome from the get go, but works for now. Would love a fix!
